        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "The sense-controlled scholarly Vedic Brahmans are always engaged in their rituals, and they donate the education of Vedas to their students, as well practice their own, and while receiving donations they are principle-minded. [1-6-13]"
